      "writtenOn": "2017-08-17T19:55:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we only enable the interrupt if rdd is disconnected or we\u0027re debouncing.\n\nI am worried that if there is a debug accessory connected, the rdd_interrupt will be triggered whenever we enable it. So on HOOK_SECOND we enable the rdd interrupt, it triggers, rdd_interrupt delays sleep by 1 second, so another HOOK_SECOND will be called and reenable the interrupt.... then we stay awake forever.\n\nThis is mainly an issue on Eve when the EC is in hibernate.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 141,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 145,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "3c4f414407db1128aec2f29e59c4bf125a144c6c",
